# The AGT tool scatters stray files across its working directory (thousands of
# string constants written out as filenames), so ignore everything by default
# and allow only the launcher and the tool jar.
#
# Generated output no longer lands here: it goes to results/run-agt/, set via
# generate_auto_output_dir in the integration pipeline.
*
!/.gitignore
!/run-agt.sh
!/llmsuite-r.jar
